{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvTWFjYXJpbyUyMCUyODE5NjAlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Macario","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/fKRzGm3BiuOv3MuolazFOEgB8EX.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6SKhqqAPrJyPz9Cx1N1jaOBqV0a.jpg","description":"Poor, hungry peasant Macario longs for just one good meal on the Day of the Dead. After his wife cooks a turkey for him, he meets three apparitions, the Devil, God, and Death. Each asks him to share his turkey, but he refuses all except Death. In return, Death gives him a bottle of water which will heal any illness. Soon, Macario is more wealthy than the village doctor, which draws the attention of the feared Inquisition.","releaseInfo":"1960","genres":["Drama","Fantasy","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"8.7","runtime":"91 min","cast":["Ignacio López Tarso","Pina Pellicer","Enrique Lucero","Mario Alberto Rodríguez","José Gálvez","Eduardo Fajardo","Consuelo Frank","José Dupeyrón"],"director":["Roberto Gavaldón"],"released":"1960-06-09T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Macabre, haunting and wonderful","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Ignacio López Tarso","character":"Macario","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iqAukImrkj53i9kLoHMhSttEcI4.jpg"},{"name":"Pina Pellicer","character":"Esposa de Macario","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5YbY5vSFK3vF6XYjZJi19BT5s4c.jpg"},{"name":"Enrique Lucero","character":"La muerte","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/73ptY5OLhr1xHZZn2pWrt0KI2qd.jpg"},{"name":"Mario Alberto Rodríguez","character":"Don Ramiro","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6fXfJlhbgDQLLlL13lctnXBeTaH.jpg"},{"name":"José Gálvez","character":"El Demonio","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/atk70JDJUVESMfL4vHlOUZbztOf.jpg"},{"name":"Eduardo Fajardo","character":"Virrey","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aBqPQPnfqbpUA6d32Q1VdXo9BrM.jpg"},{"name":"Consuelo Frank","character":"Virreina","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jJjwR